      "pdf_page": 170,
      "q": {
        "en": "Find $\\log_2 \\frac{1}{16}$.",
        "fa": "قیمت $\\log_2 \\frac{1}{16}$ را دریافت کنید."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "en": "$-4$",
          "fa": "$-4$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$4$",
          "fa": "$4$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$\\frac{1}{4}$",
          "fa": "$\\frac{1}{4}$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$-8$",
          "fa": "$-8$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "en": "$\\frac{1}{16} = 2^{-4}$ and $\\log_a a^k = k$, so $\\log_2 \\frac{1}{16} = -4$.",
        "fa": "$\\frac{1}{16} = 2^{-4}$ است و $\\log_a a^k = k$، پس $\\log_2 \\frac{1}{16} = -4$."
      },
      "idea": {
        "en": "Write the number as a power of the base; a fraction $\\frac{1}{a^k}$ equals $a^{-k}$, so its logarithm is negative.",
        "fa": "عدد را به شکل توانی از قاعده بنویسید؛ کسر $\\frac{1}{a^k}$ مساوی $a^{-k}$ است، پس لوگاریتم آن منفی است."
      }
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 178,
      "q": {
        "en": "Given $\\log 2 = 0.3010$ and $\\log 3 = 0.4771$, find $\\log 12$.",
        "fa": "اگر $\\log 2 = 0.3010$ و $\\log 3 = 0.4771$ باشد، $\\log 12$ را دریافت کنید."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "en": "$0.7781$",
          "fa": "$0.7781$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$0.1436$",
          "fa": "$0.1436$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$1.0791$",
          "fa": "$1.0791$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$1.2040$",
          "fa": "$1.2040$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "why": {
        "en": "$12 = 2^2 \\cdot 3$, so $\\log 12 = 2\\log 2 + \\log 3 = 0.6020 + 0.4771 = 1.0791$.",
        "fa": "$12 = 2^2 \\cdot 3$ است، پس $\\log 12 = 2\\log 2 + \\log 3 = 0.6020 + 0.4771 = 1.0791$."
      },
      "idea": {
        "en": "The logarithm of a product is the sum of the logarithms, and a power comes out as a factor: $\\log x^n = n\\log x$. Do not multiply the logarithms.",
        "fa": "لوگاریتم حاصل ضرب مساوی مجموع لوگاریتم‌ها است و توان به شکل ضریب بیرون می‌آید: $\\log x^n = n\\log x$. لوگاریتم‌ها را با هم ضرب نکنید."
      }
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 182,
      "q": {
        "en": "Find $\\log_8 32$.",
        "fa": "قیمت $\\log_8 32$ را دریافت کنید."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "en": "$\\frac{3}{5}$",
          "fa": "$\\frac{3}{5}$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$4$",
          "fa": "$4$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$2$",
          "fa": "$2$"
        },
        {
          "en": "$\\frac{5}{3}$",
          "fa": "$\\frac{5}{3}$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "why": {
        "en": "$8 = 2^3$ and $32 = 2^5$, so $\\log_8 32 = \\log_{2^3} 2^5 = \\frac{5}{3}\\log_2 2 = \\frac{5}{3}$.",
        "fa": "$8 = 2^3$ و $32 = 2^5$ است، پس $\\log_8 32 = \\log_{2^3} 2^5 = \\frac{5}{3}\\log_2 2 = \\frac{5}{3}$."
      },
      "idea": {
        "en": "Write the base and the number as powers of the same number; the power of the number goes on top and the power of the base goes below: $\\log_{a^n} x^m = \\frac{m}{n}\\log_a x$.",
        "fa": "قاعده و عدد را به شکل توان‌هایی از یک عدد بنویسید؛ توان عدد به صورت و توان قاعده به مخرج می‌رود: $\\log_{a^n} x^m = \\frac{m}{n}\\log_a x$."
      }
    },
